+/* OSC 52: an application (vim, tmux, ...) sets or asks for the
+ * terminal selection. On a text console there is no system
+ * clipboard; the selection is FbTerm's own, the one middle-click
+ * pastes. Only the payload after "52;<target>;" matters here. */
+void VTerm::finish_osc()
